   "bn": "ফান্ডের মধ্যে টাকা সরানো ও ফান্ডভিত্তিক রিপোর্ট।"
  },
  "steps": [
   {
    "instruction": {
     "en": "Funds & Donors > Inter-fund Transfer: General Fund to Designated Fund - Emergency, 12,345.",
     "bn": "Inter-fund Transfer: General Fund থেকে Designated Fund - Emergency ১২,৩৪৫।"
    },
    "hint": {
     "en": "Try: see the button bar",
